{"id":"vod_sn_38559","vodId":"38559","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"异世界居酒屋阿信","name_cn":"异世界居酒屋阿信","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/22e2e373a6fe3ea2fdad17e088c42ad5.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在古老和繁华并存的京都，矢泽信之（杉田智和 配音）所经营的居酒屋阿信坐落在此处，千佳忍（三森铃子 配音）是在店内工作的服务生，两人的搭档行事十分默契。让他们没有想到的是，不知从什么时候起，阿信的大门竟然连接上了异世界阿伊特力亚的入口，每一天，来这里小酌放松的异世界居民们络绎不绝。　　对生啤有着狂热热爱的汉斯（阿部敦 配音）、个性十分爽朗略微有些不拘小节的尼古拉斯（森久保祥太郎 配音）、外表看上去非常凶恶严肃但实际上很温柔的贝特霍尔德（小西克幸 配音）、斤斤计较的税务官格诺特（津田健次郎 配音），他们聚集在阿信里，共同享受着难能可贵的放松时光。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TAjPUaUN9W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H1P4VhNQCg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fHuFEuR5TB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y4ERcUkKWR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iLkJeCd4cQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fheMfKr7TY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TXL6k40Ym51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kh2KavGDCP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M35Mqyup3Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W8FB3yycyU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2EE9vqqaZV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FHbiaE6pcW1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.298Z"}